# Content (`src/content/**`)

- Collections: `posts`, `authors`, `podcast`, `legal` under `src/content/<name>/`.
- Schemas are enforced by `scripts/build-content.mjs` (outputs `src/generated/*.json`). Update `lib/content.ts` consumers when frontmatter changes.
- Image paths in frontmatter use `/src/images/...`; the content build rewrites them to `/images/...` and copies files into `public/images/`.
- Templates: `posts/1.md`, `authors/juliet-ramos.md`, `podcast/1.md`, `legal/privacy.md`.
- Author slugs in posts/podcast (e.g. `author: "david-lee"`) must match `src/content/authors/` entry ids.
- After editing markdown, run `npm run content` (or `npm run build`, which calls `content:ensure`).
